           "hide": null,
           "html": "<p>Our Irish Life Experience Team have a deep affinity with Ireland and have created the ultimate itinerary to make each students' journey-not only unique, but unforgettable.  </p><p>Students will discover unmissable experiences when they choose to travel to the Emerald Isle with our program.  A small island with a memorable punch, Ireland's breathtaking landscapes and friendly, welcoming people make everyone wanting to return for more craic.  </p><p>We encourage you to apply as soon as possible to guarantee your spot for the summer of a lifetime.   </p>"
